198u|n|The god of war and husbandry. ; One of the planets of the solar system, the fourth in order from the sun, or the next beyond the earth, having a diameter of about 4,200 miles, a period of 687 days, and a mean distance of 141,000,000 miles. It is conspicuous for the redness of its light. ; The metallic element iron, the symbol of which / was the same as that of the planet Mars.	a:nzx,126,25~nzx,126,25	n:nzx,112,10~nzx,112,10
