19k1|n|A maiden. ; The fifth month of the year, containing thirty-one days. ; The early part or springtime of life. ; The flowers of the hawthorn; -- so called from their time of blossoming; also, the hawthorn. ; The merrymaking of May Day.	n:1apd,33,2~1apd,33,2
